{"title": "Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation", "pageid": 6863, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Cultivation_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arcane Cultivation (disambiguation)\">Arcane Cultivation (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/a/aa/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elixir\">elixir</a> that grants an additional level 2 spell slot.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>From hedge wizards to high priests, these elixirs are coveted by spellcasters of any ilk.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0b1e6db730e9ac84END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-393460c202a6d943END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e8e2edf01072775cEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8c7656f5-507a-4cee-8e15-320c968539f0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8c7656f5-507a-4cee-8e15-320c968539f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8c7656f5-507a-4cee-8e15-320c968539f0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Meditation_Greater+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume to grant an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slot</a>.</li>\n<li>Replaces effects of other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\"> Condition: Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\">Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slot</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Laculite\" title=\"Suspension of Laculite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/40px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Laculite\" title=\"Suspension of Laculite\">Suspension of Laculite</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Laculite\" title=\"Laculite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Laculite_Item_Icon.png/30px-Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Laculite_Item_Icon.png/40px-Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Laculite_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Laculite\" title=\"Laculite\">Laculite</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Vitriol</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When the effect of this elixir is removed (i.e. when drinking a different elixir), you will lose a level 2 spell slot, prioritizing an already expended slot. If you have expended at least one level 2 spell slot, there is no harm in replacing this elixir (or benefit in keeping it).</li>\n<li>Drinking multiple Greater Elixirs of Arcane Cultivation in a row will not restore multiple spell slots. However, if you alternate between drinking this and a different elixir, you can restore multiple slots. For example, drinking a Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation, then a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\">Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a>, and then another Greater Elixir of Arcane Cultivation will restore two level 2 slots and one level 1 slot.</li>\n<li>If drunk by a <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>, the extra spell slot will behave like a Spellcasting spell slot rather than a Pact Magic spell slot — i.e., it will always be level 2 regardless of the Warlock's level, and it will not be restored by taking a short rest. However, it is still possible to cast Warlock spells with it.</li>\n<li>If drunk by a spellcasting character who only has level 1 spell slots at their current level, this elixir will still give them a level 2 spell slot. Although this does not provide access to any level 2 spells, they can still use the extra spell slot to upcast level 1 spells.</li>\n<li>If drunk by a character with no spellcasting features at all, this elixir will still give them a single level 2 spell slot, though they will not be able to use it for anything.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 138px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 136px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/204px-Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/306px-Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/407px-Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In-game model\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/204px-Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"136\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">In-game model</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3033/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50142/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14870/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1188/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1292390/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   78.357      1 -total\n 99.00%   77.572      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 37.03%   29.012      7 Template:Icon_text\n 33.12%   25.952     39 Template:Trim\n 16.70%   13.089      3 Template:Uid\n 13.52%   10.597      2 Template:SmItemIcon\n 11.73%    9.191      1 Template:Condition\n  9.02%    7.064      3 Template:Template_style\n  8.27%    6.480     13 Template:Ifempty\n  7.89%    6.182      1 Template:Main_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6863-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202000 and revision id 379648. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}